WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960
If you're on a split-dose prep, it's time to walk through your second dose.

2
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:05.520
Confirm with your

3
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.750
written instructions. Split dosing means you take the first half of your prep

4
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.280
the evening before,

5
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.360
and the second half the morning of your procedure — typically six hours before

6
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.240
your arrival time.

7
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:21.280
When you wake up tomorrow, mix and drink your second dose as directed on your

8
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.480
prep instructions.

9
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.800
Continue drinking clear liquids after your dose until the cutoff time we've

10
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:26.480
specified.

11
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.600
Your goal is to keep going until your output runs clear. That's how we know

12
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.600
your prep is working.

13
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.400
If you have any concerns about how things are going, call our office first

14
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.240
thing in the morning.

15
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.760
You're almost done.
